WEBVTT

00:25.730 --> 00:26.560
<b>Here’s the lighttime!</b>

00:26.710 --> 00:29.290
<b>Will you guys click the follow button?</b>

00:30.430 --> 00:31.580
<b>Lu Guang, say something!</b>

00:33.510 --> 00:34.950
<b>Follow us, please</b>

00:36.710 --> 00:37.900
<b>The rescue failed?</b>

00:38.760 --> 00:39.560
<b>I don’t care about his death.</b>

00:39.770 --> 00:40.940
<b>But how to deal with his belongings?</b>

00:41.260 --> 00:42.450
<b>To be claimed by his family?</b>

00:43.210 --> 00:44.270
<b>It may not be that simple.</b>

00:44.560 --> 00:46.480
<b>He’s also suspected in a serial murder case.</b>

00:48.450 --> 00:49.880
<b>So all his personal belongings have been confiscated.</b>

00:51.090 --> 00:52.040
<b>I'm wondering</b>

00:52.860 --> 00:54.620
<b>how I can get them back.</b>

01:12.310 --> 01:12.990
<b>Who is it?</b>

01:18.400 --> 01:19.320
<b>Captain Qian!</b>

01:20.460 --> 01:21.800
<b>Hey, long time no see..</b>

01:22.410 --> 01:25.040
<b>Why is your belly so big?</b>

01:25.860 --> 01:27.710
<b>I’ve been pregnant for over 8 months.</b>

01:28.180 --> 01:29.180
<b>It's quite obvious.</b>

01:29.930 --> 01:30.860
<b>Then you shouldn't tire yourself.</b>

01:31.440 --> 01:32.350
<b>Hurry, come in and sit down.</b>

01:32.630 --> 01:34.450
<b>Yes, yes, come in.</b>

03:43.250 --> 03:44.450
<b>How time flies.</b>

03:45.000 --> 03:46.370
<b>Bin Chen just graduated from the police college then.</b>

03:46.700 --> 03:48.640
<b>Now, he’s about to be a father.</b>

03:49.240 --> 03:50.070
<b>Indeed.</b>

03:50.930 --> 03:52.660
<b>He was impulsive after graduation.</b>

03:52.950 --> 03:54.350
<b>It’s you, Captain Qian, who took care of him.</b>

03:54.590 --> 03:55.930
<b>In his mind</b>

03:56.250 --> 03:57.650
<b>you’re always his elder brother.</b>

03:58.140 --> 04:00.520
<b>Well, that's all in the past.</b>

04:01.430 --> 04:02.820
<b>I didn't do a good job as his brother</b>

04:03.250 --> 04:04.370
<b>I quit, failing to stand with him till the end</b>

04:04.880 --> 04:05.540
<b>It doesn’t matter.</b>

04:05.900 --> 04:08.010
<b>I heard that you became a lawyer later?</b>

04:08.490 --> 04:10.250
<b>That's much better than being a police officer.</b>

04:10.890 --> 04:13.220
<b>Look at you now, even more handsome in your outfit.</b>

04:13.860 --> 04:15.540
<b>If it weren't for Bin's career aspiration,</b>

04:15.740 --> 04:18.080
<b>I’d prefer that he kept following you!</b>

04:18.080 --> 04:19.960
<b>If he wants to, I’ll definitely give a hand.</b>

04:19.960 --> 04:23.360
<b>By the way, when will Bin come back today.</b>

04:23.600 --> 04:24.620
<b>Let me give him a call.</b>

04:27.170 --> 04:29.210
<b>I heard the new case is quite tough.</b>

04:29.210 --> 04:30.880
<b>He didn't come back again last night.</b>

04:32.820 --> 04:33.340
<b>Really?</b>

04:35.400 --> 04:36.970
<b>Is he working with Li Xiao now?</b>

04:37.230 --> 04:39.900
<b>Cases assigned to him are always particularly complicated.</b>

04:43.940 --> 04:46.540
<b>Cheng Xiaoshi, can you help me with this?</b>

04:47.650 --> 04:50.260
<b>What time will you be back today?</b>

04:50.900 --> 04:53.020
<b>Our daughter is quite naughty these days.</b>

04:53.510 --> 04:55.290
<b>Captain Qian is waiting for you at home.</b>

04:56.200 --> 04:57.530
<b>Never mind. I'm not in a hurry.</b>

05:03.020 --> 05:05.350
<b>Take a nap when available. Bye.</b>

05:07.770 --> 05:08.870
<b>You heard it too.</b>

05:08.870 --> 05:10.190
<b>He's not coming back again.</b>

05:10.610 --> 05:12.210
<b>In my eight-month pregnancy</b>

05:12.210 --> 05:14.680
<b>He has spent less than a month with me at home!</b>

05:15.440 --> 05:16.400
<b>I totally understand.</b>

05:17.000 --> 05:19.440
<b>That’s why I decided to leave and start my own business.</b>

05:20.250 --> 05:21.130
<b>By the way.</b>

05:21.330 --> 05:24.140
<b>Is Bin Chen handling the case for QueDe Games recently?</b>

05:24.500 --> 05:25.350
<b>I have no idea.</b>

05:25.530 --> 05:28.010
<b>He never talks to me about work.</b>

05:28.210 --> 05:29.540
<b>Anyway, I'm not interested.</b>

05:29.700 --> 05:30.640
<b>It's too scary.</b>

05:30.970 --> 05:32.490
<b>Not good for the baby.</b>

05:32.980 --> 05:35.660
<b>The first rule I taught him was to keep his mouth shut.</b>

05:36.270 --> 05:37.880
<b>It seems that he still sticks to this.</b>

05:37.880 --> 05:38.890
<b>Great.</b>

05:40.520 --> 05:42.020
<b>You already know it's a girl?</b>

05:42.280 --> 05:43.220
<b>Of course not.</b>

05:43.580 --> 05:45.280
<b>Nowadays, doctors are not allowed to tell us.</b>

05:46.310 --> 05:48.120
<b>Bin just wants a daughter.</b>

05:48.380 --> 05:51.570
<b>So he bought this and that regardless of anything else.</b>

05:51.840 --> 05:54.940
<b>He said he was changing fate with faith.</b>

05:55.910 --> 05:57.930
<b>Don’t you think he's crazy?</b>

06:00.000 --> 06:01.990
<b>Bin Chen mentioned it to me years ago.</b>

06:02.570 --> 06:03.060
<b>By the way,</b>

06:03.430 --> 06:04.840
<b>I have brought a box of fruit.</b>

06:05.290 --> 06:07.480
<b>Ma, move it to the kitchen</b>

06:09.160 --> 06:11.500
<b>Oh, it's too heavy to move around.</b>

06:11.660 --> 06:13.300
<b>Jus leave it there. I’ll let Bin move it after he’s home.</b>

06:13.300 --> 06:14.040
<b>No big deal. Please take your seat.</b>

06:17.400 --> 06:18.710
<b>Go to the bathroom and change your clothes first.</b>

06:19.170 --> 06:21.180
<b>Put your dirty clothes in this bag.</b>

06:25.340 --> 06:26.760
<b>Ah, a plush toy</b>

06:27.280 --> 06:28.860
<b>Why is it here?</b>

06:29.750 --> 06:31.140
<b>I almost forgot.</b>

06:31.600 --> 06:32.930
<b>I saw it when I was buying clothes for you.</b>

06:33.000 --> 06:34.520
<b>It was just too cute. I couldn't resist it.</b>

06:35.900 --> 06:38.540
<b>It never occurred to me that you like collecting dolls.</b>

06:39.860 --> 06:42.340
<b>Well, they’re all for my daughter.</b>

06:42.930 --> 06:44.100
<b>Move on. Change your clothes</b>

06:46.130 --> 06:48.320
<b>Captain Qian, I'm so sorry</b>

06:48.420 --> 06:49.830
<b>You come all the way here for nothing.</b>

06:50.190 --> 06:51.550
<b>I happen to be nearby handling some affairs.</b>

06:51.550 --> 06:53.600
<b>I'll send you a message before coming next time.</b>

06:54.110 --> 06:55.060
<b>Don’t bother yourself.</b>

06:55.430 --> 06:56.680
<b>Hurry inside and take some rest.</b>

06:56.680 --> 06:58.590
<b>Alright, bye!</b>

07:02.810 --> 07:05.110
<b>Why do I feel strange all over today?</b>

07:05.940 --> 07:09.280
<b>Is Bin secretly buying stuff for our daughter again?</b>

07:10.520 --> 07:13.190
<b>Boss, your acting was too realistic.</b>

07:13.360 --> 07:15.720
<b>I really thought you were looking for the guy named Bin Chen.</b>

07:15.720 --> 07:16.820
<b>And let him replace me.</b>

07:16.860 --> 07:22.620
<b>If I hear you burp loudly again, I'll cut your throat.</b>

07:26.100 --> 07:27.100
<b>Did you get it?</b>

07:27.100 --> 07:30.620
<b>Yeah, when I moved the apples to the kitchen,</b>

07:30.620 --> 07:32.120
<b>I got one</b>

07:37.620 --> 07:39.140
<b>I’m really tied up today</b>

07:39.140 --> 07:41.280
<b>Let's have a meal together after my wife gives birth</b>

07:41.430 --> 07:44.250
<b>OK. Is the case you are dealing with so tricky?</b>

07:44.420 --> 07:45.400
<b>When do you think it can be finished？</b>

07:45.780 --> 07:46.440
<b>Hard to say</b>

07:47.010 --> 07:48.750
<b>I hope to have it done as soon as possible, of course</b>

07:49.250 --> 07:50.800
<b>I really don’t wanna miss the birth of my child</b>

07:51.650 --> 07:53.530
<b>Right, that would be a pity</b>

07:54.250 --> 07:56.630
<b>It's okay. I just drop by to visit you</b>

07:56.630 --> 07:57.370
<b>No worries</b>

07:57.960 --> 07:58.810
<b>Hmm, okay</b>

08:01.750 --> 08:03.220
<b>How does it feel? Is it good on you?</b>

08:09.180 --> 08:09.860
<b>Do it</b>

08:15.460 --> 08:17.700
<b>The doctor said it's very difficult for people to strangle themselves to death.</b>

08:18.020 --> 08:20.370
<b>Before suffocation, one will experience muscle weakness due to oxygen deprivation.</b>

08:21.040 --> 08:25.090
<b>Min Liu dislocated the cricoid cartilage in his neck in a short time.</b>

08:25.530 --> 08:26.810
<b>The rescue didn’t work in the end.</b>

08:27.930 --> 08:30.220
<b>But why did that police officer even hide it from me?</b>

08:30.320 --> 08:37.350
<b>I even asked you in the car if you knew the truth. You nodded, so I thought they had told you.</b>

08:37.350 --> 08:39.240
<b>Officer Chen,</b>

08:39.310 --> 08:41.960
<b>Can we speak directly in our conversations from now on,</b>

08:42.280 --> 08:45.100
<b>Your hints are too vague to grasp.</b>

08:45.100 --> 08:48.530
<b>Cheng Xiaoshi, I’ve known everything.</b>

08:49.680 --> 08:51.650
<b>It was me who stabbed Lu Guang.</b>

08:57.220 --> 09:00.010
<b>Before you arrive, we’ve analyzed the case briefly.</b>

09:01.020 --> 09:03.510
<b>If the criminal has the ability to remotely control others,</b>

09:03.870 --> 09:05.760
<b>let alone Ling’s attack on Lu Guang,</b>

09:06.350 --> 09:08.720
<b>it's also possible that he caused Min Liu's mysterious suicide.</b>

09:09.370 --> 09:12.860
<b>But the biggest problem is that we know nothing about him.</b>

09:13.400 --> 09:14.350
<b>Who are under control?</b>

09:14.760 --> 09:15.960
<b>When are they controlled?</b>

09:15.960 --> 09:18.010
<b>How long is the control? We know none of these.</b>

09:18.450 --> 09:21.750
<b>Once he finds out that Lu Guang is alive, it's very likely he will come again.</b>

09:22.100 --> 09:24.730
<b>This asymmetric situation is very disadvantageous to us.</b>

09:26.030 --> 09:29.480
<b>So I applied for permission from my superiors to use this special ward.</b>

09:29.810 --> 09:30.610
<b>For news blackout,</b>

09:30.980 --> 09:32.940
<b>even our guys don't know we're here.</b>

09:33.520 --> 09:36.250
<b>And this is a newly-built building that hasn't been officially put in use.</b>

09:36.530 --> 09:39.030
<b>So there won't be any other patients or medical staff moving around.</b>

09:39.360 --> 09:41.960
<b>This building is equipped with many intelligent cameras.</b>

09:42.440 --> 09:45.610
<b>After installing the hospital's internal App on our phones, we can check the surveillance footage.</b>

09:46.050 --> 09:47.120
<b>I got several accounts.</b>

09:47.170 --> 09:48.100
<b>I’m gonna send them to you.</b>

09:48.540 --> 09:49.760
<b>Once there is anything abnormal in the screen,</b>

09:50.050 --> 09:51.400
<b>we will respond as soon as possible.</b>

09:52.240 --> 09:54.300
<b>Besides, we also need to thank Ling</b>

09:54.630 --> 09:56.460
<b>for recommending a ‘familiar stranger’</b>

09:56.560 --> 09:58.900
<b>to register for hospitalization in place of Lu Guang.</b>

09:59.650 --> 10:01.130
<b>A familiar stranger?</b>

10:01.980 --> 10:04.300
<b>To take precautions against the possibility that the perpetrator is an acquaintance,</b>

10:04.400 --> 10:07.800
<b>we must find a trusted person who has little interaction with us.</b>

10:07.800 --> 10:11.330
<b>So, I requested Master Siwen to bring his father-in-law here.</b>

10:11.330 --> 10:12.040
<b>Huh?!</b>

10:12.450 --> 10:14.500
<b>Bubai Ouyang, surgery for intestinal rupture.</b>

10:14.690 --> 10:15.610
<b>Where is his family member?</b>

10:15.610 --> 10:16.730
<b>Here we are.</b>

10:16.730 --> 10:19.020
<b>Let me tell you about some postoperative recovery points.</b>

10:19.850 --> 10:21.100
<b>Is he your son?</b>

10:21.160 --> 10:22.310
<b>No, no.</b>

10:22.310 --> 10:23.690
<b>He, he's my father.</b>

10:24.120 --> 10:26.810
<b>Huh? Your father's hair is all white</b>

10:27.150 --> 10:29.820
<b>But he looks much younger than you!</b>

10:30.070 --> 10:31.740
<b>What does he usually do for anti-aging?</b>

10:31.880 --> 10:32.380
<b>Er, he, he...</b>

10:32.380 --> 10:35.610
<b>He just practices Tai Chi and climbs stairs.</b>

10:35.740 --> 10:39.060
<b>Oh, I see, that's why they say life lies in movement!</b>

10:41.810 --> 10:44.320
<b>He’s an old man indeed deep inside.</b>

10:45.990 --> 10:46.520
<b>Shut up, idiot…</b>

10:46.520 --> 10:46.910
<b>Thank you for your help
Shut up, idiot…</b>

10:46.910 --> 10:47.440
<b>Thank you for your help</b>

10:47.660 --> 10:50.030
<b>Captain Xiao and Officer Chen, thank you.</b>

10:51.800 --> 10:55.460
<b>Actually, when I was confronting ‘Ling’</b>

10:56.060 --> 10:57.700
<b>I vaguely found two details</b>

10:57.870 --> 10:59.180
<b>from his words</b>

11:00.040 --> 11:01.680
<b>They may be related to his ability.</b>

11:02.160 --> 11:03.040
<b>No!</b>

11:08.520 --> 11:10.840
<b>Your power is also related to photos, right?</b>

11:11.210 --> 11:13.230
<b>You could teleport before</b>

11:13.240 --> 11:15.120
<b>But now you have to run here.</b>

11:15.330 --> 11:17.180
<b>I can clearly recall that</b>

11:17.680 --> 11:19.840
<b>He said ‘also related to the photos’.</b>

11:20.560 --> 11:23.330
<b>Sometimes when people blurt out their own similar experiences</b>

11:23.470 --> 11:24.730
<b>they use the word ‘also’.</b>

11:24.920 --> 11:26.100
<b>If so...</b>

11:26.380 --> 11:29.690
<b>his ability may have the biggest similarity with ours.</b>

11:30.210 --> 11:31.330
<b>Activated by photos.</b>

11:33.600 --> 11:34.850
<b>Then the second detail</b>

11:35.580 --> 11:37.250
<b>This is a bit confusing to me.</b>

11:38.880 --> 11:40.690
<b>It seems I’m right.</b>

11:41.440 --> 11:43.060
<b>Interesting.</b>

11:43.060 --> 11:46.500
<b>I really wanna take it from you and experience it myself.</b>

11:46.500 --> 11:48.210
<b>He said ‘take it’</b>

11:49.330 --> 11:53.060
<b>That means our abilities can be taken away.</b>

11:54.290 --> 11:56.800
<b>Lu Guang, do you know about this?</b>

11:59.540 --> 12:00.520
<b>Not quite sure.</b>

12:02.040 --> 12:02.890
<b>Anyway,</b>

12:03.150 --> 12:04.780
<b>Since it may be related to photos...</b>

12:05.140 --> 12:07.740
<b>I immediately deleted all the information and photos</b>

12:08.000 --> 12:11.210
<b>related to the photo studio that we posted online.</b>

12:11.930 --> 12:15.240
<b>Fortunately, neither Lu Guang nor I have the habit of posting personal photos online.</b>

12:17.550 --> 12:18.860
<b>Especially Lu Guang.</b>

12:19.250 --> 12:21.180
<b>He didn't even have a social media account</b>

12:21.290 --> 12:23.000
<b>A truly invisible person online.</b>

12:24.550 --> 12:28.410
<b>Luckily, I already deleted those embarrassing photos you forced me to take.</b>

12:29.140 --> 12:32.020
<b>But why was he able to control me?</b>

12:33.110 --> 12:35.750
<b>I seldom post photos online</b>

12:36.140 --> 12:37.870
<b>There was a person who used to interact with him.</b>

12:37.870 --> 12:39.500
<b>And must have left some clues.</b>

12:40.640 --> 12:42.140
<b>To lock onto the suspect who can control others</b>

12:42.280 --> 12:44.000
<b>we can only rely on the clues left by Min Liu for now.</b>

12:44.830 --> 12:47.070
<b>Bin Chen, bring Min Liu's phone here.</b>

12:47.970 --> 12:49.690
<b>From what Min Liu said before, we can deduce that</b>

12:49.860 --> 12:50.800
<b>they should be very familiar with each other</b>

12:52.060 --> 12:54.770
<b>We’ve screened the chat records of the communication software.</b>

12:54.900 --> 12:56.170
<b>No direct evidence was found.</b>

12:56.660 --> 12:58.230
<b>But, Lu Guang...</b>

12:58.710 --> 13:00.500
<b>You can see the contents of photos, right?</b>

13:00.500 --> 13:02.360
<b>I can try.</b>

13:04.360 --> 13:07.380
<b>Our IT colleagues have cracked the password of Min Liu's phone</b>

13:07.920 --> 13:10.020
<b>Let's see if we can find some clues</b>

13:10.240 --> 13:11.380
<b>from his recent photos</b>

13:12.200 --> 13:14.040
<b>Lu Guang, you just had surgery.</b>

13:14.040 --> 13:15.000
<b>Don't push yourself too hard.</b>

13:15.000 --> 13:16.750
<b>I agree. Don't push yourself.</b>

13:16.750 --> 13:17.200
<b>Fine.</b>

13:26.960 --> 13:29.730
<b>Isn't this Officer Chen's phone?!</b>

13:29.930 --> 13:30.850
<b>Bin Chen?!</b>

13:31.550 --> 13:32.260
<b>Shit!</b>

13:33.160 --> 13:34.960
<b>Captain Xiao, take me with you!</b>

13:44.390 --> 13:46.780
<b>I'd better stay with you and Lu Guang.</b>

13:53.670 --> 13:54.490
<b>Hey, Captain Xiao!</b>

13:54.770 --> 13:55.730
<b>Have you found Officer Chen?</b>

13:55.820 --> 13:58.350
<b>No, can’t find him anywhere.</b>

14:00.560 --> 14:02.920
<b>Anything unusual when he picked you up today?</b>

14:05.650 --> 14:06.570
<b>By the way</b>

14:07.270 --> 14:09.040
<b>I also bought you a new outfit</b>

14:10.350 --> 14:13.430
<b>Um, have they updated you on the situation?</b>

14:13.970 --> 14:16.280
<b>Cheng Xiaoshi, can you help me with this?</b>

14:17.290 --> 14:18.680
<b>I may not be back today..</b>

14:18.910 --> 14:20.080
<b>The case is not over yet</b>

14:20.500 --> 14:21.680
<b>Take a nap when available</b>

14:22.200 --> 14:23.620
<b>Yes, my lady!</b>

14:24.790 --> 14:25.760
<b>If so...</b>

14:26.240 --> 14:29.480
<b>his ability may have the biggest similarity with ours.</b>

14:29.980 --> 14:31.180
<b>Activated by photos.</b>

14:32.210 --> 14:33.800
<b>Is he controlled by the criminal?</b>

14:39.460 --> 14:41.100
<b>Where is the photo here?</b>

14:42.270 --> 14:44.760
<b>Does Bin plan to replace it with the baby’s birth photo?</b>

14:47.060 --> 14:48.300
<b>If he is controlled</b>

14:48.440 --> 14:49.910
<b>he should have left through the main building exit</b>

14:50.310 --> 14:51.930
<b>But now he disappeared too quickly.</b>

14:55.620 --> 14:57.490
<b>Look, how eager your dad is</b>

14:58.080 --> 14:59.430
<b>Then let's replace this one</b>

15:19.240 --> 15:21.540
<b>You can meet your dad soon</b>

15:28.260 --> 15:29.010
<b>Bin Chen</b>

15:29.570 --> 15:39.400
<b>Bin Chen, Bin Chen, Bin Chen, Bin Chen</b>

15:39.940 --> 15:42.380
<b>Hey, Captain Xiao, have you found Bin Chen?</b>

15:43.240 --> 15:44.590
<b>Hello, hello?</b>

15:44.790 --> 15:45.800
<b>Check the surveillance footage with your phone.</b>

15:46.360 --> 15:48.410
<b>OK, let's split up to find him.</b>

15:50.500 --> 15:51.720
<b>Ah</b>

15:52.040 --> 15:53.830
<b>This, this is...</b>

15:55.200 --> 15:57.950
<b>Officer Chen fell from the building?!</b>

16:00.060 --> 16:01.400
<b>Just like EMMA.</b>

16:01.400 --> 16:02.910
<b>Someone’s coming down from the roof of the top floor!</b>

16:02.910 --> 16:03.460
<b>What?!</b>

16:06.950 --> 16:07.860
<b>I’m gonna stop him!</b>

16:08.400 --> 16:10.030
<b>The whole building only has two exits on the first floor.</b>

16:10.030 --> 16:10.800
<b>Go there and stop him</b>

16:10.800 --> 16:11.250
<b>OK!</b>

16:13.170 --> 16:14.300
<b>I'll go with you!</b>

16:14.580 --> 16:16.780
<b>No, you stay here, Ling</b>

16:19.800 --> 16:22.120
<b>Ling, why do you hit me?</b>

16:27.200 --> 16:28.300
<b>Cheng Xiaoshi!</b>

16:29.530 --> 16:31.500
<b>You’re always trying to protect me</b>

16:31.720 --> 16:32.630
<b>I really appreciate it!</b>

16:33.280 --> 16:34.480
<b>But what I need more</b>

16:35.210 --> 16:36.430
<b>Is your trust!</b>

16:39.980 --> 16:41.050
<b>Two exits on the first floor</b>

16:41.740 --> 16:43.400
<b>You and Ling can block both ends</b>

16:43.920 --> 16:44.940
<b>But how about you, alone?</b>

16:45.050 --> 16:45.690
<b>Once you leave</b>

16:46.000 --> 16:47.410
<b>I'll lock myself in the ward.</b>

16:51.800 --> 16:52.740
<b>Hurry.</b>

16:53.520 --> 16:55.210
<b>Don't let this bastard escape.</b>

17:01.220 --> 17:01.910
<b>I’ve reported the case.</b>

17:02.090 --> 17:03.790
<b>The police should be able to arrive in 15 minutes.</b>

17:04.560 --> 17:05.380
<b>Where is Captain Xiao?</b>

17:16.980 --> 17:17.870
<b>I just checked the surveillance footage.</b>

17:18.380 --> 17:19.860
<b>The elevator on the top floor cannot directly reach the first floor.</b>

17:19.970 --> 17:20.830
<b>He needs to transfer at the sixth floor.</b>

17:21.800 --> 17:24.060
<b>Go straight and turn right. There should be an emergency exit.</b>

17:25.170 --> 17:26.990
<b>Follow the emergency exit, and you can reach the first floor directly.</b>

17:27.240 --> 17:28.210
<b>In this way, you should be faster than him.</b>

17:29.220 --> 17:29.600
<b>Okay.</b>

17:32.170 --> 17:33.930
<b>Oh no, I lost him.</b>

17:35.120 --> 17:37.280
<b>The efficiency of tracking like this is really too low.</b>

17:37.890 --> 17:38.930
<b>It seems I can only...</b>

18:16.730 --> 18:17.610
<b>Got you</b>

18:22.260 --> 18:23.950
<b>Just a girl.</b>

18:24.970 --> 18:25.840
<b>You scared me.</b>

18:28.040 --> 18:29.700
<b>Give me Min Liu's phone!</b>

18:42.790 --> 18:44.080
<b>The police will be here soon.</b>

18:44.460 --> 18:45.380
<b>Don't struggle.</b>

18:51.850 --> 18:52.980
<b>It's all my fault.</b>

18:54.000 --> 18:55.440
<b>My fault.</b>

18:56.500 --> 18:57.810
<b>I'm gonna be blamed.</b>

18:58.050 --> 19:00.560
<b>No, no, no, I may be killed.</b>

19:00.620 --> 19:06.720
<b>I'll die, die!</b>

19:14.200 --> 19:17.450
<b>But you have to die first!</b>

19:17.680 --> 19:18.300
<b>Ling</b>

19:46.320 --> 19:47.320
<b>What a wild boxing style</b>

19:47.880 --> 19:50.100
<b>Is this the ‘Street Fighter’ Master Siwen often talks about?</b>

20:55.440 --> 20:56.770
<b>I'm gonna kill you.</b>

21:17.310 --> 21:18.160
<b>What?</b>

21:35.740 --> 21:36.600
<b>Finally subdued him.</b>

21:42.970 --> 21:44.450
<b>Have you found Min Liu's phone?</b>

21:44.670 --> 21:45.630
<b>Not with him.</b>

21:46.400 --> 21:48.110
<b>Could it still be with Officer Chen?</b>

21:50.720 --> 21:51.570
<b>Just you wait.</b>

21:51.690 --> 21:53.010
<b>The reinforcements are coming.</b>

21:53.300 --> 21:56.390
<b>They are already here, hahaha.</b>

22:20.510 --> 22:22.410
<b>Take the guy away</b>

22:22.980 --> 22:25.640
<b>Leave the girl to me.</b>

22:26.860 --> 22:29.040
<b>Cheng Xiaoshi, how’s it going over there?"</b>

22:29.040 --> 22:30.100
<b>Have you found the phone?"</b>
